OHOS: the OHOS hotkey parser rejects bindings with no modifier key, so the
upstream bare F1/F3 shortcut defaults never register; change those two
defaults to Ctrl+Alt+F1/F3 while keeping the Ctrl+F1/F3 fallback bindings and
every other platform's defaults untouched. This only changes OHOS's
first-run default, not a user's saved configuration.

